let. fbis — Inserted by No I of the O of 14 Nov. 2012 (AS 2012 6071). Amended by No I of the O of 23 Aug. 2017, in force since 1 Oct. 2017 (AS 2017 4863).
let. fter — Inserted by No I of the O of 14 Nov. 2012, in force since 1 Dec. 2012 (AS 2012 6071).
